## Prerequisites

- Databricks workspace with Unity Catalog enabled
- Databricks CLI ≥ 0.200 (`pip install databricks-cli` or `brew install databricks/tap/databricks`)
- Service principal or personal access token with:
  - `CREATE TABLE` on `{{ catalog_default }}.<your-schema>`
  - Read access to source data at `{{ storage_root_placeholder }}`
- Source Delta tables available at the storage root (see §Storage paths below)
{% if delivery_format == "spark_job" -%}
- **Upload source files to the UC Volume** referenced by `ROSETTA_DATA_ROOT`
  (default `/Volumes/<catalog>/<schema>/landing`) — the generated tasks read root
  inputs from `DATA_ROOT` (resolved from `ROSETTA_DATA_ROOT`)
{% endif %}
